  "specific_issues": [
    "An earpiece is discreet and flesh-tone in local color. The color label belongs to the device, without asserting a wearers skin, wearing or a communications/surveillance event. Root must select actual device/application and discreet presentation scope. Worn-owner/ear relation absent, so no wearable_accessory certificate.",
    "Hair is styled softly and tied with a ribbon. Actual hair and ribbon scopes must be preserved without inventing scalp, a wearer, specific knots or garment accessories. Actual hair owner/class and ribbon scope, owned attachment topology and existing/introduction choice need review. Native atomic hair witness must bind actual scope, never invent biological hair on a wig. Visibly worn owner absent, so wearable role remains conditional.",
    "The view is framed through a glass specimen case. This states an optical observation path and glass material, without a specimen, reflected discrepancy or necessarily visible frame border. Root must select actual image/view carrier and case/observation-surface ownership/application. Generic surface presence alone cannot prove it is the actual same case observation surface; real relation guard needed.",
    "One actual hair region is selected short, bob-shaped and with bangs. No hair addition, color, age or cutting procedure follows from the style name. Root must select exact existing hair/wig/representation owner/application and independently qualify that actual hair witness; no native proof from neutral human presence alone.",
    "The selected instant is closing time with lights dimming. Closing event phase and actual decreasing illumination remain selected, while night is only metadata. Actual event identity, actual plural illumination members and same-event relation are absent. Root must choose minimal existing scopes/application without inventing store/staff/night/count; generic existence alone cannot close those member/endpoint requirements. Light_intensity requires illumination reaching a declared receiver. This source gives dimming lights but no actual receiving surface/region. The dimming E is retained; the role proposal is conditional and must not be certified from light-member existence alone or by inventing a room receiver."
  ],
